    </main>
    
    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 border-t border-[var(--border-color)]">
        <div class="container mx-auto text-center px-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Project Limitations</h4>
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1">No Backend/Database</h5>
                    <p>All data is from a static `data.json` file. State is stored only in the user's browser.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h5 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1">No Authentication</h5>
                    <p>There is no user login or authentication system implemented in this demonstration.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h5 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1">Mock VODs</h5>
                    <p>The video player uses a single sample video file for all streams for demonstration purposes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-8">&copy; 2025 Streamify Interactive Overview | Generated from Project README</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Demo Modal -->
    <div id="demo-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div id="demo-modal-content" class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-4xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col transform scale-95 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300">
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center border-b border-[var(--border-color)]">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Channel View (Demo)</h3>
                <button id="close-modal-btn" class="text-2xl font-light text-gray-500 hover:text-black">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <!-- Modal Body -->
            <div class="flex-grow p-4 md:flex md:gap-4 overflow-y-auto">
                <div class="md:w-2/3 mb-4 md:mb-0">
                    <div class="aspect-video bg-black rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                       <p class="text-white">Video Player Placeholder</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-xl">Playing the latest hits!</h4>
                        <p class="text-md text-[var(--accent)]">GamerPro</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-1/3 bg-gray-50 border border-[var(--border-color)] rounded-lg flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="p-2 font-semibold text-center border-b border-[var(--border-color)] text-sm">Stream Chat</h5>
                    <div class="flex-grow p-2 space-y-2 overflow-y-auto text-sm">
                        <p><strong>User123:</strong> This is awesome!</p>
                        <p><strong>PixelQueen:</strong> Welcome to the stream!</p>
                        <p><strong>Bot:</strong> Remember to be nice.</p>
